{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1290760/extras/47b39b1137ef753bef19285d2f248d53.poster.avif?t=1770646501\" width=610 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1290760/extras/47b39b1137ef753bef19285d2f248d53.webm?t=1770646501\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1290760/extras/47b39b1137ef753bef19285d2f248d53.mp4?t=1770646501\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set sail for a world built for curiosity in <i>Gecko Gods</i>; a serene puzzle-adventure platformer where you explore a forgotten archipelago through the eyes of a tiny, but mighty, gecko.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Climb across sunlit ruins, weave through lush caves, and uncover the remnants of an ancient civilisation, all at your own pace. With no wrong turns, every ledge, crevice and hidden path invites discovery. Glide between islands on your small wooden boat, each stop offering new puzzles to solve, insects to snack on and secrets to uncover.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1290760/extras/3c56771df5cdc3b2ff50666ecef0f536.poster.avif?t=1770646501\" width=616 height=330 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1290760/extras/3c56771df5cdc3b2ff50666ecef0f536.webm?t=1770646501\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1290760/extras/3c56771df5cdc3b2ff50666ecef0f536.mp4?t=1770646501\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore Freely - Scale walls, ceilings and cliffs with the gecko\u2019s effortless agility.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A Gecko-sized Journey - Experience a world designed for curiosity and gentle adventure, where movement itself is part of the joy.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve Ancient Puzzles - Delve into ruins and temples filled with intuitive, environmental challenges.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sail Between Islands - Drift across tranquil seas to discover unique landscapes, each with its own atmosphere and hidden life.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With its relaxing atmosphere and intuitive blend of exploration and platforming, <i>Gecko Gods</i> invites you to see the world from a different perspective.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1290760/extras/edd4754ee7ce0ff9c1e823034d9ed182.poster.avif?t=1770646501\" width=616 height=330 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1290760/extras/edd4754ee7ce0ff9c1e823034d9ed182.webm?t=1770646501\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1290760/extras/edd4754ee7ce0ff9c1e823034d9ed182.mp4?t=1770646501\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Gecko Gods</i></strong> is inspired by some amazing games: <strong><i>A Short Hike</i></strong><i>, <strong>ABZ\u00db</strong>, <strong>Sable</strong> </i>and many other atmospheric puzzle-adventures. Check them out  if you haven't already!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1290760?t=1770646501","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/a